---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import logoImage from "../assets/images/LOGO CAJA.png";

const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="relative bg-slate-50 dark:bg-dark-800 border-t border-primary/10 dark:border-dark-600 overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Top brand gradient line -->
  <div
    class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-primary via-accent to-secondary"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-14 reveal">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 text-center md:text-left">
      <div class="col-span-1 md:col-span-2">
        <div
          class="flex items-center justify-center md:justify-start mb-4"
        >
          <Image src={logoImage} alt="Tu Caja Logo" class="h-10 w-auto" />
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 max-w-sm mx-auto md:mx-0">
          La plataforma integral para gestionar tus finanzas personales, cumplir
          tus metas y asegurar tu futuro.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-secondary dark:text-white mb-4">Sobre Tu Caja</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          <li>
            <a href="/#caracteristicas" class="hover:text-primary-700 dark:hover:text-primary-300 transition">Características</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/blog" class="hover:text-primary-700 dark:hover:text-primary-300 transition">Blog</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/nosotros" class="hover:text-primary-700 dark:hover:text-primary-300 transition">Nosotros</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/contacto" class="hover:text-primary-700 dark:hover:text-primary-300 transition">Contacto</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-secondary dark:text-white mb-4">Legal</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          <li>
            <a
              href="/terminos"
              class="hover:text-primary-700 dark:hover:text-primary-300 transition"
            >Términos de Uso</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="/privacidad"
              class="hover:text-primary-700 dark:hover:text-primary-300 transition"
            >Política de Privacidad</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-dark-600 text-center text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-500"
    >
      <p>
        &copy; {currentYear} Tu Caja App · Mundo Pixelia C.A. Todos los derechos
        reservados.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
